<speak>Thank you, Mr Tan. I will attend to the referral and keep the record of today's conversation organised. If you need to contact the bank in the meantime, please use the usual official channels. There is nothing further I need to ask you about your household arrangements today. I hope the rest of your afternoon is less interrupted, and that you are able to leave the office without taking the whole paperwork pile home with you. Thank you again for setting aside the time. Goodbye.</speak>